\pard\li48\ri4\sb134\qj\fi480\sl-235\f00 \fs21{\fs21\charscalex106\b0\i0\ul0\f00 Rere, far example, the archaic motifs introduced by the enumeration of burial customs are so completely fused with contemporary scenes that the disregard for the time element may be said to amount to a method. \par}
